cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HiPredict, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: HiPredict
abstract: >-
  Deep-learning reconstruction of the HiRISE RED4 band for observations where
  it is missing after the RED4 detector's partial failure. Includes the full
  workflow: downloading HiRISE observations, radiometric preprocessing,
  training, evaluation and inference, plus the SYN4 baseline.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Suphi
    given-names: Ardan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3555-6858"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ardan-S/HiPredict"
keywords:
  - HiRISE
  - Mars
  - Mars Reconnaissance Orbiter
  - planetary science
  - image reconstruction
  - deep learning
